        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya mutembeli izu datiyakana, hidikuyila owu aŋelu atanu nayedi nindi, Yenu musukwili hamaseki yeŋa yitanu nayiyedi yandombu yaNzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuchimu hakuya, hakusukwila cheŋa chindi hamaseki. Antu adiŋi namufunda wakanyama, adifukwili kumukishi windi, hihakuyiholokela maboŋola anunka asweja kukata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuchiyedi hakusukwila cheŋa chindi mukaluŋalwiji. Himukwila mashi neyi amufu, niyuma yejima yadiŋi mukaluŋalwiji yikweti wumi, hiyikufwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuchisatu hakusukwila cheŋa chindi namutuloŋa ninamutuseloki twameji amavulu, mwila nimashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya kaŋelu kameji amavulu hakwila nindi, Eyi Waloŋa, eyi wekala kwoku, wadiŋi kwoku, eyi Wajila nanichi chiwunasompeshi mwenimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwena nawa amwaŋili mashi awakwakujila nawatuprofwetu, nineyi nawa wunayinwishi mashi; chinayiteleli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya kameŋa hakwila nindi, Mwamweni, eyi Yehova Nzambi, Watwesha yejima, kusompa kweyi kuwasompeshaŋa kwalumbuluka kwaloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuchiwana hakusukwila cheŋa chindi hetaŋwa. Hiyakudinka Ŋovu yakubaba antu nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu hiyakubabika neyena dasweja; hiyakutuka ijina daNzambi wukweti wanta wayipupu oyu. Kwonti kwawu kubalumuka munyichima amulemeshi yena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamu chitanu hakusukwila cheŋa chindi hetanda dakanyama dawanta. Muwanta windi mwiyila nibwi; hiyakutafunya madimi awu nayikatu yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutuka Nzambi wamwiwulu nayikatu yawu namaboŋolawu. Saŋa alekelawu kubalumuka munyichima aleki nimwelaŋawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamu chitanu nachimu hakusukwila cheŋa chindi hakaloŋa keneni Yufurati. Meji indi oma nichau, kulonda kuloŋeshaŋahu dehi njila yakahitilawu anyanta ankanu akafuma kwatuntukilaŋa itaŋwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona mukanwa kachaza ŋombi, nimukanwa kakanyama, nimukanwa kakaprofwetu wakutwamba, himukwidika ademoni azonda asatu adi neyi yúula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wenowu hiyakishi awademoni, enda akoŋa yinjikijilu; enda aya kudi anyanta ankanu ampata yamunu mwishina yejima, kulonda akayipompeshi kunjita yefuku odu deneni daNzambi Watwesha yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu, nakenza neyi chenzaŋa ikombi! Muntu wukutona, wukuhemba mahinindi, kulonda abuli kwenda nzekesi antu abuli kumona nsonyi yindi, nakooleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyipompeshela kumu kwanatenuwu muHeberu nawu Amaŋedoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamu chitanu nachiyedi hakusukwila cheŋa chindi haluzwizu. Mutembeli himukufuma izu datiyakana, dikufuma kwitanda dawanta nindi, Chinamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwila ninzaji nimazu niyivumina. Hikukukanka mutentanshi weneni wakadi kumonaŋahu dehi mwashakaminawu antu hanu heseki. Kanda kukankaŋahu dehi mutentanshi wasweja wudi ochuku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyu ŋanda yeneni ayibalula nihasatu; niŋanda janyuza hijikuhumoka; niBabiloni muneni amwanuka nikudi Nzambi, kulonda amwinki lupasa lwavinyu lwakulendumuka kwandombu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yitutu yejima yitemoka nikutemoka; mpidi jamaneni kumwekana nawa nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninvula yamalola amaneni, ilola dimu deseka nantalenta yimu, hiyikufuma mwiwulu hiyikunoka hadi antu. Antu hiyakunamutuka Nzambi nachipupu chanvula yamalola, muloŋa chipupu ochu chabadika nankashi kutoha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
